<title>LATVIA: LEADING PARTY BACKS REPSHE TO STAY AS C.BANK HEAD.</title>
<headline>LEADING PARTY BACKS REPSHE TO STAY AS C.BANK HEAD.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second-largest party in parliament, Latvia's Way, decided Monday to back Einar Repshe for re-election as central bank chief in September, officials said.</p>
<p>&quot;The board of Latvia's Way decided to support the candidature of Einar Repshe to the post of central bank president,&quot; said Latvia's Way board member Indulis Berzinsh.</p>
<p>Berzinsh said that Repshe had kept to a strict monetary policy and had backed investigations into the dealings with Banka Baltiya's debt cession agreements to Lichtenstein firms.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
